Subject: [PATCH 2/8] fix(time): persistent context, real history recording,
 corrected integral
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- execute() accepts optional external FieldContext (persistent state)
- Φ a b c = initial-conditions statement (psi,phi,eps), applied at t=0 only
- Ψ x / ε x accumulate (additive) so dynamics evolve across steps
- TimeSteppingInterpreter: one interpreter + one context per run; history
  read directly from context.state (old path read a nonexistent field)
- compute_integral: left Riemann sum (constant c over n steps = c*n)
- 4 history-driven regression tests + canonical hello-world fixture
